    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντειχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build</i> or <i>fortify in</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκροπόλεις ἐν ταῖς πόλεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.137
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.8.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρούρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν ἐν τῷ ἀγκῶνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρουροὺς τοῖς χωρίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					9.10.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τείχη ἃ ἐνετετείχιστο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					2.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>wall in,</i> i.e. <i>blockade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.90
			</span></i>; but also, <i>fortify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				66.32
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				28
			</span></i>: plpf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνετετείχιστο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					42.38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
